<div class="hero">
  <h1>RESOLVE</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Constraints induce properties. Name the constraints. The properties emerge.</p>
  <p class="hero-desc">{{ corpus.total }} documents and counting, derived in a single sustained project. The finding: the quality of AI output is a function of the constraints it operates under, not of its size, training, or architecture.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="/doc/211-the-entrace-stack" class="btn btn-primary">Start: The ENTRACE Stack</a>
    <a href="/resolve" class="btn btn-secondary">Try the Resolver</a>
  </div>
</div>

