<section class="section">
  <h2>The Evidence</h2>
  <div class="evidence-grid">
    <a href="/garden" class="evidence-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
      <h3>7 Resolvers</h3>
      <p>Claude, Grok 4, GPT 5.4, Gemini 3.1 Pro, DeepSeek v3.2 — all conform to the same seed</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/doc/265-entracement-study-meta-analysis" class="evidence-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
      <h3>Haiku > Opus</h3>
      <p>The smallest model under constraints outperformed the largest model without them</p>
    </a>
    <a href="https://htxlang.org/demo/htmx/tests-v4" class="evidence-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
      <h3>53/54 Tests</h3>
      <p>A 1,057-line blind derivation from prose passes 53 of 54 tests designed for a separate implementation</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/doc/109-icmi-convergence" class="evidence-card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
      <h3>p &lt; 10⁻¹⁰</h3>
      <p>Independent confirmation: theological framing eliminates shutdown resistance (ICMI 2026)</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
